# Droplet deploy safety (parkinglot workspace)

This workspace is **parkinglot only**. The mobile-home-parks server is a **different IP** and must never receive this code.

## Allowed

- SSH alias: **`parkinglot`** (`209.38.142.108`, user `root`)
- Remote path: **`/opt/workspaces/parkinglot`** (see `deploy/droplet.target`)
- Sync/rebuild: **`make droplet-sync`**, **`./scripts/sync-to-droplet.sh`**, **`./scripts/remote-rebuild.sh`** — they validate `deploy/droplet.target`

## Forbidden

- `DROPLET=134.199.209.177`, `DROPLET=mobile-home-parks`, or any host other than **`parkinglot`** / `209.38.142.108` for this repo
- Raw `rsync` to an IP without running the assert script in `scripts/lib/droplet-target.sh`
- Telling the user to paste parkinglot `deploy/.env` or compose onto the mobile-home-parks Droplet

## If deploy fails with “DROPLET MISMATCH”

The user has the right protection. They should use a **second Cursor window** for the other project. See `docs/CURSOR-TWO-PROJECTS.md`.

## Two Cursor windows

- Window 1: this repo + host `parkinglot`
- Window 2: mobile-home-parks repo + host `mobile-home-parks` (not your job in this workspace)
